  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Jus 601.02 Scope. This chapter shall apply to all claimants, including their representatives, and all providers who wish to accept compensation payments granted by the commission.\n\nSource. #4864, eff 7-13-90; amd by #5430, eff 7-1-92, EXPIRED: 7-1-98\n\nNew. #7117, eff 10-8-99, EXPIRED: 10-8-07\n\nNew. #9553, eff 9-25-09, EXPIRED: 9-25-17\n\nNew. #12938, eff 12-9-19",
